# text = Because the trains were delayed, because the buses were full, because the taxis were too expensive, and because walking would have taken nearly two hours, we did what any reasonable group of adults would do in that situation: we went back inside, ordered another round of tea, and argued for forty-five minutes about whose idea it had been to come in the first place.
