# text = Among the items recovered from the site were: three bronze coins, a broken comb, two clay lamps, a bone needle, several iron nails of varying sizes, a fragment of painted plaster showing what may be a bird or possibly a leaf, and a small glass bead, blue with white swirls, that the excavators nicknamed "the marble."
